  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ongoing Emergency Response to the War in Ukraine 2023  (contribution to EA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partner: Caritas Ukraine (CUA)

Contribution to CI Appeal: EA31/2022 Ukraine

Total number of direct beneficiaries (individuals): 308,814

Context:  Since the start of the war, Caritas Ukraine and a growing number of local Caritas organizations have been implementing emergency response programming across the country. With support from CI Member Organizations via the EA 03/22, which will close at the end of December 2022, CUA was able to provide over two million services as of mid-December. With this new EA, Caritas Ukraine and local Caritas organisations will continue their essential work. 

Key activities: providing places of temporary residence, supporting the repair/reconstruction of homes, provision of drinking water and hygiene assistance, provision of hot meals and food kits, protection of vulnerable population, capacity building of local Caritas organisations</narrative>
  </description>
